:''This type of stage has no official name.''
'''Invasion Stages''' or '''Invasions''' are a type of stage introduced in the [[Version 5.6 Update]]. Invasions are alternate versions of other stages that replace them temporarily, changing their appearance on the map and the background behind their name. Clearing an Invasion will permanently turn the stage back to normal, meaning each Invasion can only be cleared once per save file.
[[File:Filibusterbigbang.png|thumb|right|[[The Big Bang (Cats of the Cosmos)|The Big Bang]] [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)|invaded]] by [[Filibuster Obstructa]] in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3]]

With the exception of [[Zombie Outbreaks]], which disappear on their own after some time, all Invasions last until they are cleared. All Invasions except Zombie Outbreaks are also [[No Continues]] stages.

